s MO/Lyceum/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_26\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_27\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_28\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_30\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018052258\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 206/1000000\nPost‐expand include siz